    "text": "iheart.com\nwebsite\nWest Manchester Township, Pennsylvania\nPennsylvania Man Charged with Illegal Firearm Possession\n2 days ago\nA Pennsylvania man, Israell Lee Saez, is facing multiple charges after being found with a firearm at the York Fairgrounds on Monday (July 21). The West Manchester Township Police arrested Saez, 33, after he was seen leaving an unauthorized trailer with a gun. Saez claimed his boss instructed him to retrieve the firearm, but the boss later denied this.\n18",
